          "rules": "videogames: questions about video game sales, platforms, genres, publishers, the vgsales dataset.\nmusic_store: questions about music, artists, albums, tracks, invoices \u2014 the Chinook store database.\nlive_data: ONLY weather/forecasts, country statistics (population, GDP), or recent earthquakes \u2014 the four wired data APIs.\nbuild_workflow: ONLY explicit requests to create something new on this platform ('build me a workflow/team that ...', 'create a pipeline for ...'). Questions about how the platform or its parts WORK are general, never build_workflow.\ngeneral: everything else \u2014 greetings, general knowledge, questions about this platform itself, and anything needing a web search (news, versions, current events)."
